The Belfry OpenScad Library, v2.0: the top-level .scad modules that
std.scad pulls in, plus the upstream LICENSE and README.md, copied verbatim
from the pinned commit. The examples/, tests/, images/, resources/,
scripts/ and tutorials/ directories are not vendored. The workshop wrappers
use std.scad, joiners.scad and sliders.scad.

